Task 2: Implement Firewall Automation
Overview
Create Python scripts to automate iptables firewall configuration with security hardening rules.

Step 1: Initialize Firewall Environment
Clear existing rules and set secure defaults:

# Clear all existing rules
sudo iptables -F
sudo iptables -X
sudo iptables -t nat -F
sudo iptables -t nat -X

# Set default policies
sudo iptables -P INPUT DROP
sudo iptables -P FORWARD DROP
sudo iptables -P OUTPUT ACCEPT
