Troubleshooting Tips
FreeRADIUS not starting:

Check configuration syntax: sudo freeradius -X
Verify port 1812 is not in use: sudo netstat -tulpn | grep 1812
Review logs: sudo tail -f /var/log/freeradius/radius.log
Iptables rules not persisting:

Install persistence package: sudo apt install iptables-persistent
Save rules manually: sudo netfilter-persistent save
Check saved rules: sudo cat /etc/iptables/rules.v4
Authentication tests failing:

Verify RADIUS secret matches in clients.conf
Check user credentials in users file
Ensure FreeRADIUS service is running: sudo systemctl status freeradius
Python script permission errors:

Run with sudo for iptables commands: sudo python3 script.py
Check script is executable: chmod +x script.py
Locked out after firewall configuration:

Access via console (not SSH) if available
Flush rules: sudo iptables -F && sudo iptables -P INPUT ACCEPT
Always test rules before saving permanently
